        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Of course. We receive fan mail, emails and photos from kids, or we’ll get messages from parents about their child wanting to be an engineer and asking us questions about how to get into the field. That’s the really cool thing.</span></span></p>\n",
